.TH RGBMATRIXFX 1 "2026" "RGBMatrixFX" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rgbmatrixfx \- lighting effects for Razer keyboards and mice (window)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rgbmatrixfx
[\fB\-\-theme\fR \fIsystem|dark|light\fR] [\fB\-\-accent\fR \fIsystem|rgbmatrixfx|#rrggbb\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-plugins\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the RGBMatrixFX window: pick and tune effects, presets, highlight keys, zones and settings.
The lighting itself is rendered by
.BR rgbmatrixfx\-engine (1),
a systemd user service that keeps running when the window is closed.
On the first start of a packaged RGBMatrixFX the window enables and starts that service
(Settings \(-> Startup changes it).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-theme " " \fIsystem|dark|light\fR
Override Settings \(-> Appearance for this run.
.TP
.BR \-\-accent " " \fIsystem|rgbmatrixfx|#rrggbb\fR
Override the accent colour for this run.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-plugins
Start without loading plugins (also RGBMATRIXFX_NO_PLUGINS=1).
.TP
.BR \-\-config " " \fIfile\fR
Use another configuration file.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rgbmatrixfx/config.json
effects, presets and engine settings
.TP
.I ~/.config/rgbmatrixfx/gui.ini
window state and appearance
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/rgbmatrixfx/plugins/
plugins
.TP
.I ~/.cache/rgbmatrixfx/gui.log
window log
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rgbmatrixfx\-engine (1),
.BR openrazer\-daemon (8)
.PP
https://github.com/nitrofireinc-pixel/RGBMatrixFX
